    "title_en": "Topics in Celestial holography: A bottom-up perspective",
    "abstract_en": "We review some selected topics in celestial holography on the search for a celestial dual to quantum gravity in flat spacetimes. We focus on the bottom-up approach, emphasizing symmetries, key elements in celestial CFT, interplay with twistor theory, and connection to AdS/CFT.",
